Editing-changed callback

ControllerView enters edit mode when the app passes isEditing: true,
but the layout editor's Done only resets the view's internal state. An
app that changes its own touch handling while the editor is open (all
touches to the editor, none to the game behind it) needs to know when
editing ends.

New optional init parameter onEditingChanged, called with the new value
whenever edit mode starts or ends.

Upstream: not submitted.

